            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_jYYdma": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Wat zijn de voordelen van gripsokken?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_twiGfi": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>HÏ Grip gripsokken bieden <strong>maximale grip en controle</strong>, waardoor sporters stabieler bewegen en minder risico hebben op blessures of blaren. De <strong>versterkte onderzijde en ademende sportstof </strong>van HÏ Grip zorgen voor extra comfort en frisse, droge voeten tijdens elke training. Ontworpen door professionals en geschikt voor <strong>alle sporten</strong>, waardoor je altijd het beste uit je performance haalt.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_twiGfi"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_rJzNEW": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Zijn gripsokken wetenschappelijk bewezen?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_7NAjYD": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Gripsokken zijn <strong>wetenschappelijk bewezen</strong> effectiever dan normale sokken: ze houden de voet beter op zijn plek, verbeteren stabiliteit en verminderen uitglijden tijdens snelle of explosieve bewegingen. Studies tonen aan dat gripsokken bijna <strong>twee keer zoveel grip</strong> bieden (wrijvingscoëfficiënt 1,17 vs. 0,60), wat direct zorgt voor meer controle en vertrouwen. Kortom: <strong>minder glijden, meer stabiliteit en betere performance</strong>. </p><p><br/>(<a href=\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/02640414.2019.1690618\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/02640414.2019.1690618\">Apps et al., 2020</a>; <a href=\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/02640414.2022.2080163\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/02640414.2022.2080163\">Apps et al., 2022</a>; <a href=\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/19424280.2023.2212628\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/19424280.2023.2212628\">Friedl et al., 2023</a>)</p><p><br/></p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_7NAjYD"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_zGKLfa": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Heeft HÏ Grip ook een zakelijk aanbod?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_DBtrEJ": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Ontdek onze zakelijke aanbiedingen <a href=\"/pages/zakelijk\" title=\"Zakelijk\">hier</a>!</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
